	(text "RP2350B with Raspberry Pi's minimal-design support circuit (HDDSynthPro's): core regulator,\n12 MHz crystal, 16 MB QSPI flash, USB; and 8 MB PSRAM on XIP CS1 (GPIO 8), as on the BB48R.\nGPIO numbers as in src/config.h. GPIO 29 (amp SD_MODE) and 30 (card detect) are new on rev C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
